===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|dagr||day|lang=non}}.

===Noun===
{{infl|fo|noun|g=m}}

# [[day]], the time between sunrise and sunset
# [[daylight]]
# day, 24 hours
# ({{p}}) [[life]], [[lifetime]]
# [[consciousness]]

